{"title":"Imp","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 1 Imp that attacks with burn (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 3 times (1.7% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/imp\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=0\">Lv 0 <span>108</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=1\">Lv 1 <span>8</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=2\">Lv 2 <span>231</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=3\">Lv 3 <span>122</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=5\">Lv 5 <span>34</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=8\">Lv 8 <span>5</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=10\">Lv 10 <span>37</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=11\">Lv 11 <span>12</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=12\">Lv 12 <span>12</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=13\">Lv 13 <span>5</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=0\" title=\"Pick level 0\"><td><b>0</b></td><td>12</td><td>1</td><td>50</td><td class=\"muted\">36 · 1.4 · 150</td><td>108</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Smoldering%20Den\">Smoldering Den</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=1\" title=\"Pick level 1\"><td><b>1</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>12</td><td>1</td><td>50</td><td class=\"muted\">36 · 1.4 · 150</td><td>8</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Ogre%20Den\">Ogre Den</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=2\" title=\"Pick level 2\"><td><b>2</b></td><td>14</td><td>2.2</td><td>100</td><td class=\"muted\">42 · 3.1 · 300</td><td>231</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binxonia\">Binxonia</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=3\" title=\"Pick level 3\"><td><b>3</b></td><td>16</td><td>3.1</td><td>150</td><td class=\"muted\">48 · 4.3 · 450</td><td>122</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Windthorne\">Windthorne</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=5\" title=\"Pick level 5\"><td><b>5</b></td><td>20</td><td>5.1</td><td>250</td><td class=\"muted\">60 · 7.1 · 750</td><td>34</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=8\" title=\"Pick level 8\"><td><b>8</b></td><td>26</td><td>8.9</td><td>400</td><td class=\"muted\">78 · 12.5 · 1,200</td><td>5</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=10\" title=\"Pick level 10\"><td><b>10</b></td><td>31</td><td>10</td><td>500</td><td class=\"muted\">93 · 14 · 1,500</td><td>37</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Ogre%20Den\">Ogre Den</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/imp\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>11</b></td><td>34</td><td>10.6</td><td>550</td><td class=\"muted\">102 · 14.8 · 1,650</td><td>12</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=12\" title=\"Pick level 12\"><td><b>12</b></td><td>37</td><td>11.1</td><td>600</td><td class=\"muted\">111 · 15.5 · 1,800</td><td>12</td><td>near <a href=\"#